 if (authViewModel.canProceedToAuthentication()) { // DB call on main thread!
 currentStep = AuthenticationStep.AUTHENTICATION;
 }
}

// ✅ AFTER: Proper MVVM pattern with LiveData observation
private void checkAuthenticationState() {
 // Observe AuthState LiveData instead of direct method calls
 // Async initialization in AuthViewModel determines correct state
}
```

#### **3. ViewModel Utility Methods:**
```java
