- **✅ No main thread blocking** during ViewModel initialization 
- **✅ Proper MVVM pattern** with LiveData observation
- **✅ Consistent async operations** throughout the app
- **✅ Error resilience** with fallback to safe states
- **✅ Better performance** with non-blocking UI initialization
- **✅ Future-proof architecture** with deprecated method warnings

