nt credentials initialized successfully\");\n \n } catch (IOException e) {\n Log.e(TAG, \"Failed to initialize Google credentials\", e);\n credentials = null;\n }\n }\n \n /**\n * Get valid access token (refresh if needed)\n */\n public String getAccessToken() {\n if (credentials == null) {\n Log.e(TAG, \"Credentials not initialized\");\n return null;\n }\n \n try {\n // Refresh credentials to get fresh token\n credentials.refreshIfExpired();\n \n // Get the access token\n return credentials.getAccessToken().getTokenValue();\n \n } catch (Exception e) {\n Log.e(TAG, \"Failed to get access token\", e);\n return null;\n }\n }\n \n /**\n * Check if service account is properly configured\n */\n public boolean isConfigured() {\n return credentials != null;\n }\n \n /**\n * Get service account email for logging\n */\n public String getServiceAccountEmail() {\n if (credentials instanceof com.google.auth.oauth2.ServiceAccountCredentials) {\n return ((com.google.auth.oauth2.ServiceAccountCredentials) credentials)\n .getClientEmail();\n }\n return \"unknown\";\n }\n \n /**\n * Force token refresh (for testing)\n */\n public void forceRefresh() {\n try {\n if (credentials != null) {\n credentials.refresh();\n Log.d(TAG, \"Forced token refresh completed\");\n }\n } catch (IOException e) {\n Log.e(TAG, \"Failed to refresh token\", e);\n }\n }\n}"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","name":"edit_file","tool_call_id":"toolu_018GsPavktHAJdjHRig5XWsE","content":"The apply model made the following changes to the file:

