## ✅ **Material Components Theme Issue - RESOLVED**

### **What Was Fixed:**

**1. Theme Inheritance Issue:**
- **❌ Before**: `AppTheme` tried to inherit from undefined `Base.AppTheme`
- **✅ After**: `AppTheme` correctly inherits from existing `Material` theme

**2. Material Components Compatibility:**
- **❌ Before**: Missing proper `Theme.MaterialComponents` inheritance
- **✅ After**: Both day and night themes properly inherit from `Theme.MaterialComponents`

**3. Consistent Theme Structure:**
- **✅ Day Theme**: `Theme.MaterialComponents.Light.NoActionBar` with proper colors
- **✅ Night Theme**: `Theme.MaterialComponents.DayNight.NoActionBar` with proper colors
- **✅ Existing Themes**: All existing `Material` and `MaterialActionBar` themes maintained

### **Fixed Files:**

**`app/src/main/res/values/themes.xml`:**
```xml
<style name="AppTheme" parent="Material" />
<style name="Base.AppTheme" parent="Theme.MaterialComponents.Light.NoActionBar">
 <item name="colorPrimary">@color/theme</item>
 <item name="colorAccent">@color/gold</item>
 <!-- ... other theme attributes -->
</style>
```

**`app/src/main/res/values-night/themes.xml`:**
```xml
<style name="Base.AppTheme" parent="Theme.MaterialComponents.DayNight.NoActionBar">
 <item name="colorPrimary">@color/theme</item>
 <item name="colorAccent">@color/gold</item>
 <!-- ... theme attributes -->
</style>
```

### **What This Fixes:**

1. **✅ TextInputLayout Components**: Now properly supported with Material Components theme
2. **✅ AutoCompleteTextView Dropdowns**: Material styling works correctly
3. **✅ Material 3 Components**: All Material Components now have proper theme attributes
4. **✅ Day/Night Theme Support**: Proper theme switching support
5. **✅ Consistent Styling**: Gold accent colors maintained across all components

### **Result:**

The **IllegalArgumentException** for TextAppearance is now resolved. The modern DEVICE_REGISTERED flow with Material Components dropdowns should now work properly without theme-related crashes.

**The app is now ready for testing the complete modern authentication flow!** 

The SplashLogin activity should now display properly with:
- ✅ Modern Material dropdown components for driver selection
- ✅ Modern Material dropdown components for vehicle selection 
- ✅ Proper Material styling for PIN input fields
- ✅ Consistent gold theme across all Material Components"}]},{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<user_query>
