 - Vehicle selected → "Start session" enabled

### **Modern User Experience:**

**Elegant Single-Flow Authentication:**
```
1. ✨ Splash completes → "Checking authentication..." fades out smoothly
2. ✨ Driver dropdown animates in → User selects → "Continue" enables
3. ✨ PIN field slides in → User enters 4 digits → Button auto-enables 
4. ✨ Vehicle dropdown transitions in → User selects → "Start session" ready
5. ✨ Session starts → Navigate to TripDash
```

**Visual Improvements:**
- **Clean Animations**: Jetpack Compose-style smooth transitions
- **Gold Theme**: Consistent theming throughout
- **Modern Typography**: Proper font weights and sizing
- **Smart UX**: Fields appear dynamically as needed
- **No Button Spam**: Single-click progression

### **Technical Implementation:**

**Animation System:**
```java
// Smooth field hiding with slide up
view.animate()
 .alpha(0f)
 .translationY(-20f)
 .setDuration(200)
 .withEndAction(() -> view.setVisibility(View.GONE))

// Elegant field showing with slide down
view.animate()
 .alpha(1f)
 .translationY(0f)
 .setDuration(300)
 .setInterpolator(new DecelerateInterpolator())
```

**Smart Button Management:**
```java
// Auto-enable based on field state
binding.etPin.addTextChangedListener(new SimpleTextWatcher() {
 @Override
 public void afterTextChanged(Editable s) {
 if (s.length() == 4) {
 updateButton("Authenticate", true);
 }
 }
});
```

**Custom Themed Dropdowns:**
- Custom `dropdown_item_driver.xml` and `dropdown_item_vehicle.xml`
- Gold text color and proper spacing
- Clean selectable backgrounds

